---
import BlockLayout from '../layouts/BlockLayout.astro';
const built = new Date().toISOString();
---
<BlockLayout title="Cast Cradle — pad that fades you to sleep" description="A drone that knows when to leave. Pick a duration and a mood, press start. The pad fades to silence over the time you chose. Optional rain, optional heartbeat. No app, no signup, no upsell.">
  <main class="cc" id="cc" data-built={built}>
    <header class="cc__hero">
      <p class="cc__kicker">CAST · CRADLE · sleep · slow fade · rain · heartbeat</p>
      <h1 class="cc__title">Cradle.</h1>
      <p class="cc__sub">A drone that knows when to leave. Pick a duration and a mood, press start. The pad fades to silence over the time you chose. You can fall asleep without remembering to stop anything.</p>
    </header>

    <section class="cc__panel">
      <div class="cc__panel-row">
        <p class="cc__panel-label">DURATION</p>
        <div class="cc__pills" id="cc-duration-pills">
          <button class="cc__pill" data-duration="15">15 min</button>
          <button class="cc__pill cc__pill--active" data-duration="30">30 min</button>
          <button class="cc__pill" data-duration="45">45 min</button>
          <button class="cc__pill" data-duration="60">60 min</button>
          <button class="cc__pill" data-duration="90">90 min</button>
        </div>
      </div>

      <div class="cc__panel-row">
        <p class="cc__panel-label">MOOD</p>
        <div class="cc__pills" id="cc-mood-pills">
          <button class="cc__pill cc__pill--active" data-mood="warm">warm · Eb major 7</button>
          <button class="cc__pill" data-mood="cool">cool · D major 9</button>
          <button class="cc__pill" data-mood="deep">deep · A minor 11</button>
          <button class="cc__pill" data-mood="moon">moon · F# sus2</button>
        </div>
      </div>

      <div class="cc__panel-row cc__panel-row--toggles">
        <div class="cc__toggle">
          <button class="cc__toggle-btn" id="cc-rain-btn" aria-pressed="false">
            <span class="cc__toggle-name">RAIN</span>
            <span class="cc__toggle-state" id="cc-rain-state">off</span>
          </button>
          <input type="range" class="cc__toggle-slider" id="cc-rain-amt" min="0" max="100" value="40" disabled/>
        </div>
        <div class="cc__toggle">
          <button class="cc__toggle-btn" id="cc-heart-btn" aria-pressed="false">
            <span class="cc__toggle-name">HEARTBEAT</span>
            <span class="cc__toggle-state" id="cc-heart-state">off</span>
          </button>
          <input type="range" class="cc__toggle-slider" id="cc-heart-amt" min="40" max="80" value="62" disabled/>
        </div>
      </div>
    </section>

    <section class="cc__stage" data-state="idle" id="cc-stage">
      <button class="cc__play" id="cc-play" type="button" aria-label="Start the cradle">
        <span class="cc__play-icon" id="cc-play-icon">▶</span>
        <span class="cc__play-label" id="cc-play-label">START</span>
      </button>
      <div class="cc__readout">
        <span class="cc__readout-time" id="cc-readout-time">30:00</span>
        <span class="cc__readout-sub" id="cc-readout-sub">remaining</span>
      </div>
      <div class="cc__fade-meter">
        <div class="cc__fade-fill" id="cc-fade-fill"></div>
      </div>
      <p class="cc__stage-hint" id="cc-stage-hint">Headphones or low-volume speakers. The pad starts loud-ish, holds for the first third, then fades the rest of the way to silence.</p>
    </section>

    <section class="cc__notes">
      <h2 class="cc__notes-h">What this isn't</h2>
      <p>This isn't a sleep tracker. It's not a meditation. It's a pad that gets quieter on a schedule. Most "sleep music" apps either play forever (so you wake up to it at 3am) or play for an hour without fading (and the silence at the cutoff wakes you). This one fades.</p>
      <h2 class="cc__notes-h">What's making the sound</h2>
      <p>Three detuned sawtooth oscillators stacked at chord intervals, through a 24dB low-pass filter that slowly closes over the duration, through a long stereo delay, through a master gain envelope shaped: <strong>ramp up over 15s · hold for 1/3 of duration · exponential decay to silence for the remainder</strong>.</p>
      <p>Rain is bandpassed white noise (1.2–4 kHz). Heartbeat is a 60Hz sine pulse with a 40ms decay, scheduled at your BPM. All synthesized — no samples.</p>
      <p>Other surfaces: <a href="/cast-wander">/cast-wander</a> · <a href="/cast-breathe">/cast-breathe</a> · <a href="/cast-tone">/cast-tone</a> · <a href="/cast-on">/cast-on</a>.</p>
    </section>
  </main>

  <style is:global>
    :root {
      --cc-ink: #0d0518;
      --cc-walnut: #4a2a1a;
      --cc-flame: #f6c15e;
      --cc-flame-deep: #d68f2c;
      --cc-cream: #f4e7c8;
      --cc-cream-dim: #c8b48a;
      --cc-cream-dimmer: #8b7a5a;
      --cc-mauve: #8b6fb3;
      --cc-rose: #c98ba3;
    }

    body:has(.cc) {
      background:
        radial-gradient(circle at 20% 8%, #221538 0%, transparent 40%),
        radial-gradient(circle at 90% 60%, #1a1228 0%, transparent 50%),
        var(--cc-ink);
      color: var(--cc-cream);
      font-family: 'Inter', -apple-system, system-ui, sans-serif;
      min-height: 100vh;
    }

    .cc {
      max-width: 880px;
      margin: 0 auto;
      padding: 48px 24px 80px;
    }

    .cc__hero { text-align: center; margin-bottom: 36px; }
    .cc__kicker {
      font-family: 'JetBrains Mono', ui-monospace, monospace;
      font-size: 11px;
      letter-spacing: 0.18em;
      color: var(--cc-flame-deep);
      text-transform: uppercase;
      margin: 0 0 12px;
    }
    .cc__title {
      font-family: 'Inter Tight', 'Inter', sans-serif;
      font-weight: 900;
      font-size: clamp(56px, 12vw, 132px);
      letter-spacing: -0.04em;
      line-height: 0.9;
      margin: 0 0 16px;
      color: var(--cc-flame);
      text-shadow: 0 6px 24px rgba(0,0,0,0.4);
    }
    .cc__sub {
      max-width: 640px;
      margin: 0 auto;
      font-size: 17px;
      line-height: 1.5;
      color: var(--cc-cream-dim);
    }

    /* PANEL */
    .cc__panel {
      background: rgba(0,0,0,0.32);
      border: 1px solid rgba(246,193,94,0.14);
      border-radius: 20px;
      padding: 20px 22px;
      margin-bottom: 28px;
    }
    .cc__panel-row {
      margin-bottom: 18px;
    }
    .cc__panel-row:last-child { margin-bottom: 0; }
    .cc__panel-row--toggles {
      display: grid;
      grid-template-columns: 1fr 1fr;
      gap: 14px;
    }
    @media (max-width: 600px) { .cc__panel-row--toggles { grid-template-columns: 1fr; } }
    .cc__panel-label {
      font-family: 'JetBrains Mono', monospace;
      font-size: 10px;
      letter-spacing: 0.18em;
      color: var(--cc-cream-dimmer);
      margin: 0 0 10px;
    }
    .cc__pills {
      display: flex;
      flex-wrap: wrap;
      gap: 8px;
    }
    .cc__pill {
      font-family: 'Inter Tight', sans-serif;
      font-weight: 600;
      font-size: 13px;
      padding: 8px 14px;
      border-radius: 10px;
      border: 1px solid rgba(246,193,94,0.28);
      background: transparent;
      color: var(--cc-cream);
      cursor: pointer;
      transition: background 100ms ease, border-color 100ms ease, color 100ms ease;
    }
    .cc__pill:hover { background: rgba(246,193,94,0.10); }
    .cc__pill--active {
      background: var(--cc-flame);
      color: var(--cc-walnut);
      border-color: var(--cc-flame);
    }
    .cc__toggle {
      display: flex;
      flex-direction: column;
      gap: 8px;
      padding: 12px 14px;
      background: rgba(244,231,200,0.04);
      border: 1px solid rgba(246,193,94,0.18);
      border-radius: 12px;
    }
    .cc__toggle-btn {
      display: flex;
      justify-content: space-between;
      align-items: baseline;
      padding: 0;
      border: 0;
      background: transparent;
      color: var(--cc-cream);
      cursor: pointer;
      text-align: left;
    }
    .cc__toggle-name {
      font-family: 'Inter Tight', sans-serif;
      font-weight: 700;
      font-size: 14px;
    }
    .cc__toggle-state {
      font-family: 'JetBrains Mono', monospace;
      font-size: 10px;
      letter-spacing: 0.12em;
      color: var(--cc-cream-dimmer);
      text-transform: uppercase;
    }
    .cc__toggle-btn[aria-pressed="true"] .cc__toggle-state {
      color: var(--cc-flame);
    }
    .cc__toggle-slider {
      width: 100%;
      accent-color: var(--cc-flame);
    }
    .cc__toggle-slider:disabled { opacity: 0.35; }

    /* STAGE */
    .cc__stage {
      background: rgba(0,0,0,0.35);
      border: 1px solid rgba(246,193,94,0.16);
      border-radius: 20px;
      padding: 36px 28px 32px;
      margin-bottom: 32px;
      display: flex;
      flex-direction: column;
      align-items: center;
      gap: 20px;
    }
    .cc__play {
      display: flex;
      flex-direction: column;
      align-items: center;
      gap: 6px;
      padding: 0;
      border: 0;
      background: transparent;
      cursor: pointer;
    }
    .cc__play-icon {
      width: 96px;
      height: 96px;
      border-radius: 50%;
      background: var(--cc-flame);
      color: var(--cc-walnut);
      font-size: 36px;
      display: flex;
      align-items: center;
      justify-content: center;
      box-shadow: 0 8px 32px rgba(246,193,94,0.32);
      transition: transform 100ms ease, background 100ms ease;
    }
    .cc__play:hover .cc__play-icon { transform: scale(1.04); }
    .cc__play:active .cc__play-icon { transform: scale(0.96); }
    .cc__play-label {
      font-family: 'JetBrains Mono', monospace;
      font-size: 10px;
      letter-spacing: 0.18em;
      color: var(--cc-cream-dim);
      margin-top: 8px;
    }
    .cc__stage[data-state="playing"] .cc__play-icon {
      animation: ccPulse 4s ease-in-out infinite;
    }
    @keyframes ccPulse {
      0%, 100% { box-shadow: 0 8px 32px rgba(246,193,94,0.32); }
      50% { box-shadow: 0 8px 60px rgba(246,193,94,0.55); }
    }
    .cc__readout {
      display: flex;
      flex-direction: column;
      align-items: center;
      gap: 2px;
    }
    .cc__readout-time {
      font-family: 'Inter Tight', sans-serif;
      font-weight: 900;
      font-size: 56px;
      color: var(--cc-flame);
      letter-spacing: -0.02em;
      line-height: 1;
      font-variant-numeric: tabular-nums;
    }
    .cc__readout-sub {
      font-family: 'JetBrains Mono', monospace;
      font-size: 11px;
      letter-spacing: 0.14em;
      color: var(--cc-cream-dimmer);
      text-transform: uppercase;
    }
    .cc__fade-meter {
      width: 100%;
      max-width: 480px;
      height: 4px;
      border-radius: 2px;
      background: rgba(244,231,200,0.1);
      overflow: hidden;
    }
    .cc__fade-fill {
      width: 0%;
      height: 100%;
      background: linear-gradient(to right, var(--cc-flame), var(--cc-mauve));
      transition: width 250ms linear;
    }
    .cc__stage-hint {
      max-width: 520px;
      text-align: center;
      font-size: 13px;
      color: var(--cc-cream-dimmer);
      line-height: 1.55;
      margin: 0;
    }

    /* NOTES */
    .cc__notes {
      max-width: 720px;
      margin: 0 auto;
      padding: 28px 0 0;
      border-top: 1px solid rgba(246,193,94,0.14);
    }
    .cc__notes-h {
      font-family: 'Inter Tight', sans-serif;
      font-weight: 700;
      font-size: 20px;
      color: var(--cc-cream);
      margin: 24px 0 10px;
    }
    .cc__notes-h:first-child { margin-top: 0; }
    .cc__notes p {
      font-size: 15px;
      line-height: 1.6;
      color: var(--cc-cream-dim);
      margin: 0 0 12px;
    }
    .cc__notes strong { color: var(--cc-cream); }
    .cc__notes a {
      color: var(--cc-flame);
      text-decoration: none;
    }
    .cc__notes a:hover { text-decoration: underline; }
  </style>

  <script>
    import { createAudioScheduler } from '../lib/audio-scheduler';

    type Mood = 'warm' | 'cool' | 'deep' | 'moon';

    // Mood = root + chord intervals in semitones from root
    const MOODS: Record<Mood, { name: string; rootHz: number; intervals: number[] }> = {
      warm:  { name: 'warm',  rootHz: 77.78,  intervals: [0, 4, 7, 11, 14] },     // Eb maj7 + 9
      cool:  { name: 'cool',  rootHz: 73.42,  intervals: [0, 4, 7, 11, 14] },     // D maj7 + 9
      deep:  { name: 'deep',  rootHz: 55.00,  intervals: [0, 3, 7, 10, 14, 17] }, // Am11
      moon:  { name: 'moon',  rootHz: 92.50,  intervals: [0, 2, 7, 9, 14] },      // F# sus2
    };

    let duration = 30; // minutes
    let mood: Mood = 'warm';
    let rainOn = false;
    let heartOn = false;
    let rainAmt = 0.4;
    let heartBpm = 62;
    let playing = false;

    let ctx: AudioContext | null = null;
    let scheduler: ReturnType<typeof createAudioScheduler> | null = null;
    let masterGain: GainNode | null = null;
    let padNodes: { osc: OscillatorNode; gain: GainNode; }[] = [];
    let padFilter: BiquadFilterNode | null = null;
    let rainSrc: AudioBufferSourceNode | null = null;
    let rainGain: GainNode | null = null;
    let startedAt = 0;
    let totalSeconds = 0;
    let countdownTimer: number | null = null;
    let heartTimer: number | null = null;

    function midiToHz(rootHz: number, semitones: number): number {
      return rootHz * Math.pow(2, semitones / 12);
    }

    function getNoiseBuffer(ac: AudioContext): AudioBuffer {
      const len = ac.sampleRate * 4;
      const buf = ac.createBuffer(1, len, ac.sampleRate);
      const data = buf.getChannelData(0);
      for (let i = 0; i < len; i++) data[i] = Math.random() * 2 - 1;
      return buf;
    }

    function formatTime(s: number): string {
      const mm = Math.floor(s / 60);
      const ss = Math.floor(s % 60);
      return `${String(mm).padStart(2, '0')}:${String(ss).padStart(2, '0')}`;
    }

    function tickCountdown() {
      if (!playing || !ctx) return;
      const elapsed = (ctx.currentTime - startedAt);
      const remaining = Math.max(0, totalSeconds - elapsed);
      document.getElementById('cc-readout-time')!.textContent = formatTime(remaining);
      const pct = totalSeconds > 0 ? (elapsed / totalSeconds) * 100 : 0;
      (document.getElementById('cc-fade-fill') as HTMLElement).style.width = `${pct}%`;
      if (remaining <= 0) {
        stopAll();
        document.getElementById('cc-readout-sub')!.textContent = 'finished';
        document.getElementById('cc-stage')!.setAttribute('data-state', 'idle');
        document.getElementById('cc-play-icon')!.textContent = '▶';
        document.getElementById('cc-play-label')!.textContent = 'START';
        return;
      }
    }

    function startPad() {
      if (!ctx || !scheduler || !masterGain) return;
      const spec = MOODS[mood];
      padFilter = ctx.createBiquadFilter();
      padFilter.type = 'lowpass';
      padFilter.Q.value = 0.8;
      padFilter.frequency.value = 1800;
      // Slowly close filter over the duration
      padFilter.frequency.setValueAtTime(1800, ctx.currentTime);
      padFilter.frequency.linearRampToValueAtTime(450, ctx.currentTime + totalSeconds);
      padFilter.connect(masterGain);

      // Each interval = a pair of slightly detuned saws for thickness
      padNodes = [];
      for (const semis of spec.intervals) {
        for (const detune of [-6, 6]) {
          const osc = ctx.createOscillator();
          const g = ctx.createGain();
          osc.type = 'sawtooth';
          osc.frequency.value = midiToHz(spec.rootHz, semis);
          osc.detune.value = detune;
          // Gentle per-voice gain so the stack doesn't peak
          g.gain.value = 0.06 / spec.intervals.length;
          osc.connect(g).connect(padFilter);
          scheduler.trackSource(osc);
          osc.start();
          padNodes.push({ osc, gain: g });
        }
      }

      // Master envelope: ramp up 15s · hold 1/3 · decay rest
      const v = 0.9; // master gain at peak
      const rampUp = Math.min(15, totalSeconds * 0.05);
      const hold = totalSeconds * 0.33;
      const decay = totalSeconds - rampUp - hold;
      const t0 = ctx.currentTime;
      masterGain.gain.cancelScheduledValues(t0);
      masterGain.gain.setValueAtTime(0.0001, t0);
      masterGain.gain.linearRampToValueAtTime(v, t0 + rampUp);
      masterGain.gain.setValueAtTime(v, t0 + rampUp + hold);
      masterGain.gain.exponentialRampToValueAtTime(0.0001, t0 + rampUp + hold + decay);
    }

    function startRain() {
      if (!ctx || !scheduler || !masterGain || rainSrc) return;
      const src = ctx.createBufferSource();
      src.buffer = getNoiseBuffer(ctx);
      src.loop = true;
      const bp = ctx.createBiquadFilter();
      bp.type = 'bandpass';
      bp.frequency.value = 2400;
      bp.Q.value = 0.4;
      const hp = ctx.createBiquadFilter();
      hp.type = 'highpass';
      hp.frequency.value = 1100;
      const g = ctx.createGain();
      g.gain.value = rainAmt * 0.22;
      src.connect(hp).connect(bp).connect(g).connect(masterGain);
      scheduler.trackSource(src);
      src.start();
      rainSrc = src;
      rainGain = g;
    }

    function stopRain() {
      if (rainSrc) {
        try { rainSrc.stop(); } catch {}
        try { rainSrc.disconnect(); } catch {}
        rainSrc = null;
      }
      rainGain = null;
    }

    function playHeartbeat(t: number) {
      if (!ctx || !scheduler || !masterGain) return;
      const osc = ctx.createOscillator();
      const g = ctx.createGain();
      osc.type = 'sine';
      osc.frequency.setValueAtTime(70, t);
      osc.frequency.exponentialRampToValueAtTime(40, t + 0.12);
      g.gain.setValueAtTime(0.0001, t);
      g.gain.exponentialRampToValueAtTime(0.32, t + 0.008);
      g.gain.exponentialRampToValueAtTime(0.0001, t + 0.18);
      osc.connect(g).connect(masterGain);
      scheduler.trackSource(osc);
      osc.start(t);
      osc.stop(t + 0.22);

      // Second softer beat shortly after (lub-DUB)
      const osc2 = ctx.createOscillator();
      const g2 = ctx.createGain();
      osc2.type = 'sine';
      osc2.frequency.setValueAtTime(60, t + 0.16);
      osc2.frequency.exponentialRampToValueAtTime(35, t + 0.28);
      g2.gain.setValueAtTime(0.0001, t + 0.16);
      g2.gain.exponentialRampToValueAtTime(0.22, t + 0.17);
      g2.gain.exponentialRampToValueAtTime(0.0001, t + 0.32);
      osc2.connect(g2).connect(masterGain);
      scheduler.trackSource(osc2);
      osc2.start(t + 0.16);
      osc2.stop(t + 0.34);
    }

    function startHeart() {
      if (!ctx || heartTimer != null) return;
      const intervalMs = 60000 / heartBpm;
      const tick = () => {
        if (!playing || !ctx || !heartOn) return;
        playHeartbeat(ctx.currentTime + 0.01);
        heartTimer = window.setTimeout(tick, intervalMs);
      };
      heartTimer = window.setTimeout(tick, 200);
    }

    function stopHeart() {
      if (heartTimer != null) { clearTimeout(heartTimer); heartTimer = null; }
    }

    function startAll() {
      if (!ctx) {
        ctx = new (window.AudioContext || (window as any).webkitAudioContext)();
        scheduler = createAudioScheduler(ctx);
        masterGain = ctx.createGain();
        masterGain.gain.value = 0;
        masterGain.connect(ctx.destination);
      }
      if (ctx.state === 'suspended') ctx.resume();
      playing = true;
      totalSeconds = duration * 60;
      startedAt = ctx.currentTime;
      startPad();
      if (rainOn) startRain();
      if (heartOn) startHeart();
      tickCountdown();
      if (countdownTimer != null) clearInterval(countdownTimer);
      countdownTimer = window.setInterval(tickCountdown, 250);
    }

    function stopAll() {
      playing = false;
      if (countdownTimer != null) { clearInterval(countdownTimer); countdownTimer = null; }
      stopHeart();
      stopRain();
      if (scheduler) scheduler.stopAll();
      padNodes = [];
      padFilter = null;
    }

    function setActivePill(rowId: string, attr: string, value: string) {
      const row = document.getElementById(rowId)!;
      row.querySelectorAll(`[data-${attr}]`).forEach(el => {
        el.classList.toggle('cc__pill--active', el.getAttribute(`data-${attr}`) === value);
      });
    }

    function init() {
      // Initial readout
      document.getElementById('cc-readout-time')!.textContent = formatTime(duration * 60);

      // Duration pills
      document.getElementById('cc-duration-pills')!.addEventListener('click', e => {
        const btn = (e.target as HTMLElement).closest('[data-duration]');
        if (!btn) return;
        duration = parseInt(btn.getAttribute('data-duration')!);
        setActivePill('cc-duration-pills', 'duration', String(duration));
        if (!playing) {
          document.getElementById('cc-readout-time')!.textContent = formatTime(duration * 60);
        }
      });

      // Mood pills
      document.getElementById('cc-mood-pills')!.addEventListener('click', e => {
        const btn = (e.target as HTMLElement).closest('[data-mood]');
        if (!btn) return;
        mood = btn.getAttribute('data-mood') as Mood;
        setActivePill('cc-mood-pills', 'mood', mood);
      });

      // Rain toggle
      const rainBtn = document.getElementById('cc-rain-btn')!;
      const rainSlider = document.getElementById('cc-rain-amt') as HTMLInputElement;
      rainBtn.addEventListener('click', () => {
        rainOn = !rainOn;
        rainBtn.setAttribute('aria-pressed', String(rainOn));
        document.getElementById('cc-rain-state')!.textContent = rainOn ? 'on' : 'off';
        rainSlider.disabled = !rainOn;
        if (playing) {
          if (rainOn) startRain();
          else stopRain();
        }
      });
      rainSlider.addEventListener('input', () => {
        rainAmt = parseInt(rainSlider.value) / 100;
        if (rainGain && ctx) {
          rainGain.gain.setTargetAtTime(rainAmt * 0.22, ctx.currentTime, 0.1);
        }
      });

      // Heart toggle
      const heartBtn = document.getElementById('cc-heart-btn')!;
      const heartSlider = document.getElementById('cc-heart-amt') as HTMLInputElement;
      heartBtn.addEventListener('click', () => {
        heartOn = !heartOn;
        heartBtn.setAttribute('aria-pressed', String(heartOn));
        document.getElementById('cc-heart-state')!.textContent = heartOn ? `${heartBpm} bpm` : 'off';
        heartSlider.disabled = !heartOn;
        if (playing) {
          if (heartOn) startHeart();
          else stopHeart();
        }
      });
      heartSlider.addEventListener('input', () => {
        heartBpm = parseInt(heartSlider.value);
        if (heartOn) {
          document.getElementById('cc-heart-state')!.textContent = `${heartBpm} bpm`;
          // restart at new interval
          stopHeart();
          startHeart();
        }
      });

      // Play / stop
      document.getElementById('cc-play')!.addEventListener('click', () => {
        const stage = document.getElementById('cc-stage')!;
        if (playing) {
          stopAll();
          stage.setAttribute('data-state', 'idle');
          document.getElementById('cc-play-icon')!.textContent = '▶';
          document.getElementById('cc-play-label')!.textContent = 'START';
          document.getElementById('cc-readout-time')!.textContent = formatTime(duration * 60);
          document.getElementById('cc-readout-sub')!.textContent = 'remaining';
          (document.getElementById('cc-fade-fill') as HTMLElement).style.width = '0%';
        } else {
          startAll();
          stage.setAttribute('data-state', 'playing');
          document.getElementById('cc-play-icon')!.textContent = '■';
          document.getElementById('cc-play-label')!.textContent = 'STOP EARLY';
          document.getElementById('cc-readout-sub')!.textContent = 'remaining';
        }
      });

      // visibility: pause if tab hidden (so we don't fight the OS)
      document.addEventListener('visibilitychange', () => {
        if (document.hidden && playing && ctx) {
          // Don't stop entirely — most users want it to keep going behind a lock screen.
          // But suspend the AudioContext so iOS doesn't yell.
          ctx.suspend().catch(() => {});
        } else if (!document.hidden && playing && ctx) {
          ctx.resume().catch(() => {});
        }
      });
    }

    if (document.readyState === 'loading') {
      document.addEventListener('DOMContentLoaded', init);
    } else {
      init();
    }
  </script>
</BlockLayout>
